{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Of the first of your dough.</b> Why is this said? Since it is stated ״רֵאשִׁית עֲרִסֹתֵכֶם״, I would understand the first of the doughs — Scripture states <b>מראשית</b> — part of it, not all of it (Sifrei)." "<b>You shall give to YHWH an offering.</b> Since we have not heard a measure for hallah, it states ״תִּתְּנוּ״ — that it should have enough to be given (ibid.)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:02.207468749Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}